description	"Black Vulkar Swoop Ganger

Ruthless Gang members specialized in close quarters hit and run tactics.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Stun Baton (1)
-- Inflicts Cripple
- Vulkar Heavy Carbine (1) 
-- DC Carbine (1)
-- 20% More Velocity, 20% Slower RoF
-- 15% More Damage/FP Drain
-- Mag Reload
- Plasma Grenades (4)
-- Thermal Grenades
-- 50% More Damage
-- 60% Faster RoF 
-- Ignites
- Vulkar Max Charge Pistol
-- 60% More Damage, 20% More Velocity
-- Max Reload, 1 Shot, Cripples On Hit

^8Attributes: 
- Dash (1) ^3[CS2]
- 150% Slower Cooldowns
- Personal Energy Shield ^3[CS2]
- Dexterity/Roll (1) ^3[CS4]
- Reinforcements (2)
- Blast Armor 
- Ammo (3)
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]"
